        "AbstractText": "The recognition and reporting of stromal and vascular lesions of the lymph node is rife with difficulties including relative rarity, a lack of familiarity with lesions and the challenges of using ancillary studies appropriately. In this manuscript, we highlight a range of benign stromal and vascular abnormalities that can be identified in nodal specimens."
